WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:46.889
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:47.159 --> 01:51.686
[Episode 12]

3
01:54.040 --> 01:56.823
- Okay. - Strike.

4
01:56.823 --> 01:58.560
- Strike. - Xiao Ning.

5
01:58.560 --> 01:59.920
Be careful with your toys.

6
01:59.920 --> 02:01.740
I'll be right there.

7
02:03.560 --> 02:04.719
Xiao Ning.

8
02:04.719 --> 02:06.419
Yeah?

9
02:07.640 --> 02:09.142
Come here.

10
02:10.960 --> 02:12.360
Come.

11
02:14.639 --> 02:15.639
Xiao Ning.

12
02:15.639 --> 02:17.560
Daddy has to go out for a meeting.

13
02:17.560 --> 02:19.520
Can you play at home for a while?

14
02:19.520 --> 02:21.280
You're going to a meeting again.

15
02:21.280 --> 02:22.639
You're leaving me all alone.

16
02:22.639 --> 02:25.300
I'll be so bored by myself.

17
02:25.960 --> 02:28.240
Be a good boy.

18
02:28.240 --> 02:31.120
I'll find someone to play with you, okay?

19
02:31.120 --> 02:32.819
Okay.

20
02:46.240 --> 02:47.319
See you next time.

21
02:47.319 --> 02:49.020
Thank you.

22
02:57.680 --> 02:58.680
Okay, I understand.

23
02:58.680 --> 02:59.760
Let's leave it at that for now.

24
02:59.760 --> 03:01.720
Cancel all the work you can lately.

25
03:01.720 --> 03:02.759
I have someone important to see.

26
03:02.759 --> 03:04.680
Daddy, I dropped my ball.

27
03:04.680 --> 03:06.438
I dropped my ball.

28
03:06.438 --> 03:09.141
Be good. Daddy will buy you a new one.

29
03:34.360 --> 03:38.499
Has Daddy's friend already left?

30
03:43.973 --> 03:45.780
Be good, Ji Ning.

31
03:45.780 --> 03:46.879
Daddy will play with you.

32
03:46.879 --> 03:50.280
The guest in this room has checked out.

33
03:50.280 --> 03:51.840
What should we do, Daddy?

34
03:51.840 --> 03:54.219
No one will play with me now.

35
04:00.000 --> 04:01.860
My ball!

36
04:08.719 --> 04:10.460
Mr. Ji.

37
04:12.640 --> 04:14.339
This is...

38
04:14.966 --> 04:17.279
I got the time wrong.

39
04:17.279 --> 04:20.219
- I thought today... - My ball!

40
04:23.120 --> 04:24.256
Stay.

41
04:24.256 --> 04:25.600
Okay.

42
04:25.600 --> 04:28.460
Great! Someone's here to play with me!

43
04:30.406 --> 04:31.760
Greet him.

44
04:31.760 --> 04:33.621
Hello, Mr. Shen.

45
04:34.640 --> 04:36.860
Hello, Xiao Ning.

46
04:39.520 --> 04:41.221
How's your hand?

47
04:47.990 --> 04:50.160
It's almost fully healed.

48
04:50.160 --> 04:52.581
Remember to apply the medicine twice today.

49
04:53.480 --> 04:55.000
Since you're not leaving,

50
04:55.000 --> 04:56.839
what are your plans for today?

51
04:56.839 --> 04:58.759
I'll probably be painting indoors during the day.

52
04:58.759 --> 05:01.120
I'd like to go for a walk on the beach in the afternoon.

53
05:01.120 --> 05:02.359
So, you're free then.

54
05:02.359 --> 05:04.701
I guess so.

55
05:04.701 --> 05:06.544
Do me a favor.

56
05:06.544 --> 05:09.380
Help me... take care of Ji Ning.

57
05:10.240 --> 05:12.960
Daddy doesn't want me anymore.

58
05:12.960 --> 05:14.520
I have to meet a client today.

59
05:14.520 --> 05:16.017
I have to leave soon.

60
05:16.017 --> 05:17.738
Ji Ning keeps pestering me,

61
05:17.738 --> 05:19.959
insisting that I stay with him.

62
05:19.959 --> 05:22.513
But I don't know how to mind a child.

63
05:22.513 --> 05:23.880
The nanny is here.

64
05:23.880 --> 05:25.439
You just need to be there...

65
05:25.439 --> 05:27.480
and keep an eye on him.

66
05:27.480 --> 05:29.959
Sir, play with me.

67
05:32.760 --> 05:34.475
You're the only one I trust.

68
05:36.019 --> 05:37.621
All right.

69
05:38.386 --> 05:39.747
Let's go to my place.

70
05:39.747 --> 05:41.947
I have everything we need there.

71
05:41.947 --> 05:42.986
The nanny is there.

72
05:42.986 --> 05:44.960
Tell her if you need anything.

73
05:44.960 --> 05:46.120
I'll be out at sea during the day.

74
05:46.120 --> 05:47.867
I'll be back around evening.

75
05:47.867 --> 05:50.046
We can have dinner together then.

76
05:54.707 --> 05:56.269
Call me if anything comes up.

77
05:56.269 --> 05:57.711
Ji Ning knows my number.

78
05:57.711 --> 06:00.160
- Right? - Of course.

79
06:00.160 --> 06:02.922
Speak Chinese when you talk to him.

80
06:02.922 --> 06:04.981
Of course!

81
06:09.699 --> 06:13.599
We look just like a family of three.

82
06:14.826 --> 06:16.366
Mr. Ji.

83
06:16.366 --> 06:17.946
Chen.

84
06:17.946 --> 06:19.933
This is an old friend of mine.

85
06:19.933 --> 06:22.386
He's here to play with Ji Ning.

86
06:22.386 --> 06:23.645
I have things to attend to,

87
06:23.645 --> 06:25.467
so I'll be going now.

88
06:25.467 --> 06:28.640
Mr. Ji, don't you worry.

89
06:28.640 --> 06:30.960
An old friend?

90
06:30.960 --> 06:33.139
I guess he could say that.

91
06:34.000 --> 06:35.780
Ji Ning is usually quite spoiled.

92
06:35.780 --> 06:37.440
He can be a bit willful.

93
06:37.440 --> 06:39.826
Shen Mo, you don't have to be too easy on him.

94
06:39.826 --> 06:41.200
Is that so?

95
06:41.200 --> 06:43.193
He seems quite well-behaved to me.

96
06:48.320 --> 06:49.680
- It's the most exciting. - Right.

97
06:49.680 --> 06:52.219
Okay, let's spray your hands.

98
06:54.600 --> 06:56.781
This hand, too.

99
06:58.480 --> 07:00.606
All right, go play.

100
07:00.606 --> 07:02.160
- I'm off! - Be careful!

101
07:02.160 --> 07:04.440
Oh, look! A dragonfly!

102
07:12.667 --> 07:14.327
By the way, Chen...

103
07:15.480 --> 07:17.740
Didn't Mrs. Ji come along?

104
07:18.587 --> 07:20.346
Mr. Ji is here for business,

105
07:20.346 --> 07:22.947
so he only brought the young master.

106
07:22.947 --> 07:26.167
Mr. Shen, come here!

107
07:27.067 --> 07:28.766
Coming!

108
07:35.986 --> 07:39.126
Young Master, try some steamed egg.

109
07:39.126 --> 07:40.532
Okay.

110
07:41.947 --> 07:43.727
You have some.

111
07:49.666 --> 07:52.886
Daddy told me to take good care of you.

112
07:54.187 --> 07:56.707
Ji Ning and you really hit it off.

113
07:56.707 --> 08:00.466
He's not this well-behaved with others.

114
08:00.466 --> 08:03.187
Does Mr. Ji come to M Island often?

115
08:03.187 --> 08:05.027
The hotel just opened,

116
08:05.027 --> 08:06.786
so he's been coming quite frequently.

117
08:06.786 --> 08:09.306
Mr. Ji cares a lot about this hotel.

118
08:09.306 --> 08:12.546
He even named it himself.

119
08:12.546 --> 08:14.786
SEAMO.

120
08:14.786 --> 08:17.566
It couldn't mean "Thinking of Mo," could it?

121
08:21.346 --> 08:23.786
Don't flatter yourself.

122
08:23.786 --> 08:27.126
I'm full! Let's go play, Mr. Shen!

123
08:27.747 --> 08:29.306
No more playing.

124
08:29.306 --> 08:30.591
It's nap time.

125
08:30.591 --> 08:36.112
Aw... You're just like Daddy.

126
08:38.307 --> 08:42.027
Xiao Ning, how does your dad usually put you to sleep?

127
08:42.027 --> 08:43.866
Similar to you, Mr. Shen...

128
08:43.866 --> 08:46.437
but also a little different.

129
08:47.346 --> 08:48.986
How so?

130
08:48.986 --> 08:50.387
He tells me stories,

131
08:50.387 --> 08:53.746
and he always holds me from this side.

132
08:53.746 --> 08:55.786
I see.

133
08:55.786 --> 08:58.586
If only you both could sleep with me.

134
08:58.586 --> 08:59.587
One on each side.

135
08:59.587 --> 09:02.466
I could hug whoever I want.

136
09:02.466 --> 09:04.486
In your dreams.

137
09:07.186 --> 09:10.627
My dad is the best person to hug,

138
09:10.627 --> 09:13.066
but you're not bad either, Mr. Shen.

139
09:13.066 --> 09:17.020
I wish Daddy could feel it, too.

140
09:17.020 --> 09:18.946
You little rascal...

141
09:18.946 --> 09:20.647
Go to sleep.

142
09:39.243 --> 09:40.306
Chen.

143
09:40.306 --> 09:43.467
I didn't expect Ji Ning to be so close to you.

144
09:43.467 --> 09:46.267
He's usually very shy around strangers.

145
09:46.267 --> 09:47.867
This little guy and Ji Ming Xuan

146
09:47.867 --> 09:49.920
are cut from the same cloth.

147
09:49.920 --> 09:52.162
Maybe we just hit it off.

148
09:52.162 --> 09:54.426
Mr. Ji must trust you a lot.

149
09:54.426 --> 09:58.966
Mr. Ji has never let an outsider take care of Ji Ning before.

150
10:00.600 --> 10:02.532
Speaking of which,

151
10:02.532 --> 10:06.073
I've known Mr. Ji for many years.

152
10:27.320 --> 10:30.060
Looking for Daddy.

153
10:31.006 --> 10:32.626
Mr. Shen.

154
10:32.626 --> 10:34.367
You're awake.

155
10:35.706 --> 10:40.387
Mr. Shen, I want to play a game.

156
10:40.387 --> 10:42.387
All right, my little master.

157
10:42.387 --> 10:44.726
What game do you want to play?

158
10:45.760 --> 10:47.186
You want to play a phone game?

159
10:47.186 --> 10:49.545
But I don't have any games on my phone.

160
10:51.920 --> 10:54.200
Daddy's phone has them.

161
10:55.107 --> 10:56.880
This is your dad's phone?

162
10:56.880 --> 10:59.627
Yeah, unlock it for me.

163
10:59.627 --> 11:01.987
All right. But only for a little while.

164
11:01.987 --> 11:03.806
Hurry, hurry!

165
11:05.107 --> 11:07.747
Why is your dad so frugal?

166
11:07.747 --> 11:10.186
He still keeps such an old phone.

167
11:10.186 --> 11:13.606
Daddy uses this phone all the time.

168
11:19.546 --> 11:21.345
You must have sat here too,

169
11:21.345 --> 11:24.005
watching Ji Ning play.

170
11:26.840 --> 11:28.259
Died again!

171
11:28.259 --> 11:29.422
I'm done.

172
11:29.422 --> 11:31.760
It's no fun at all.

173
11:31.760 --> 11:34.866
All right, kids shouldn't be glued to the phone.

174
11:42.906 --> 11:43.953
[Shen Mo] [Xiao Mo]

175
11:43.953 --> 11:45.586
[Shen Mo, where are you?] [Did you leave with Zhou Yang?]

176
11:45.586 --> 11:47.180
[Come back] [Shen Mo, don't go]

177
11:47.180 --> 11:48.843
[Stay] [Remain by my side]

178
11:52.659 --> 11:53.917
[Shen Mo, where are you?] [Did you leave with Zhou Yang?]

179
11:53.917 --> 11:55.423
[Come back] [Shen Mo, don't go]

180
11:55.423 --> 11:56.862
[Stay] [Remain by my side]

181
12:03.107 --> 12:05.920
Mr. Ji, there's news on Zhou Yang, the one you asked me to watch.

182
12:05.920 --> 12:07.186
Go on.

183
12:07.186 --> 12:08.747
He contacted Mr. Shen.

184
12:08.747 --> 12:11.606
He said something about taking him away.

185
12:14.720 --> 12:16.786
I see.

186
12:16.786 --> 12:18.887
Is there anything else I should do?

187
12:20.826 --> 12:22.627
No.

188
12:22.627 --> 12:24.267
You don't need to watch Zhou Yang anymore.

189
12:24.267 --> 12:25.806
Understood.

190
12:35.347 --> 12:37.387
It seems you like to drink, Mr. Ji.

191
12:37.387 --> 12:39.127
Let's have a few.

192
13:08.867 --> 13:10.747
Is something on your mind, Mr. Ji?

193
13:10.747 --> 13:12.887
Why do you keep drinking?

194
13:17.867 --> 13:19.147
Ming Xuan.

195
13:19.147 --> 13:21.387
You can tell me anything.

196
13:21.387 --> 13:24.846
To me, you've never been just a business partner.

197
13:39.107 --> 13:41.387
Ming Xuan, you've had too much to drink.

198
13:41.387 --> 13:43.227
I'll take you home.

199
13:43.227 --> 13:44.927
Home?

200
13:46.666 --> 13:48.920
Yes.

201
13:48.920 --> 13:50.504
I want to go home.

202
13:50.504 --> 13:52.766
Come on, let's go home.

203
13:55.373 --> 13:57.606
You're not him.

204
13:57.606 --> 13:59.746
I want to go to our home.

205
14:09.027 --> 14:10.828
To Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

206
14:10.828 --> 14:12.828
Mr. Ji, aren't you going home?

207
14:15.360 --> 14:17.587
To Jinxiu Mountain Villa.

208
14:17.587 --> 14:19.847
That's our home.

209
14:24.000 --> 14:25.826
I'm going to find him.

210
14:25.826 --> 14:27.806
I'm going to wait for him there.

211
14:35.586 --> 14:36.987
You're awake.

212
14:36.987 --> 14:38.700
Give me your phone.

213
14:38.700 --> 14:41.039
I'll call in for you.

214
14:53.134 --> 14:55.483
Someone sent you a ton of texts.

215
14:55.483 --> 14:56.546
Want to check them?

216
14:56.546 --> 14:58.400
Just delete them all.

217
14:58.400 --> 14:59.866
Are you sure?

218
14:59.866 --> 15:00.959
Yeah.

219
15:00.959 --> 15:03.060
Don't regret it later.

220
15:04.386 --> 15:07.347
I don't know why I said that.

221
15:07.347 --> 15:10.480
Did I want him to see those texts?

222
15:10.480 --> 15:12.180
I don't know.

223
15:12.840 --> 15:14.442
If he really wanted to see them,

224
15:14.442 --> 15:16.543
would I even dare to let him?

225
15:18.000 --> 15:19.673
Let's just leave it at that.

226
15:19.673 --> 15:25.786
At least, at this very moment, you're still by my side.

227
15:25.786 --> 15:27.487
Shen Mo.

228
15:32.440 --> 15:33.826
So...

229
15:33.826 --> 15:36.682
that's why he wanted to go to Jinxiu Mountain Villa so badly that night.

230
15:36.682 --> 15:39.973
So, these were the texts he deleted.

231
15:39.973 --> 15:41.053
What if...

232
15:41.053 --> 15:43.736
I had seen the content of those texts then?

233
15:43.736 --> 15:45.636
What would have happened?

234
15:48.080 --> 15:49.827
Mr. Shen, what's wrong?

235
15:49.827 --> 15:51.926
Are you crying?

236
15:52.839 --> 15:55.126
No, I'm not crying.

237
15:55.126 --> 15:56.768
But your eyes are all red.

238
15:56.768 --> 15:58.989
Why are you crying?

239
16:02.233 --> 16:04.072
Xiao Ning.

240
16:04.072 --> 16:05.366
Can I give you a hug?

241
16:05.366 --> 16:07.528
Sure! Come here!

242
16:10.186 --> 16:13.365
This is Ji Ming Xuan's own flesh and blood.

243
16:18.680 --> 16:21.220
- Xiao Ning. - Yes?

244
16:21.852 --> 16:23.059
Does your dad love you?

245
16:23.059 --> 16:24.640
Yes, he does.

246
16:26.546 --> 16:28.007
Then...

247
16:29.266 --> 16:30.940
Does your dad love your mom too?

248
16:30.940 --> 16:32.639
Yes, he does.

249
16:37.013 --> 16:38.712
That's good.

250
16:42.890 --> 16:44.859
Let's go play in the living room.

251
16:44.859 --> 16:46.560
Let's go!

252
16:50.792 --> 16:52.772
Rooster.

253
16:53.980 --> 16:55.919
Hen.

254
16:57.367 --> 16:59.661
Strike!

255
17:02.447 --> 17:04.208
Xiao Ning.

256
17:04.208 --> 17:05.909
Daddy!

257
17:06.986 --> 17:09.379
Xiao Ning, have you been good at home?

258
17:09.379 --> 17:11.464
Of course. Ask Mr. Shen if you don't believe me.

259
17:11.464 --> 17:13.124
Right?

260
17:14.120 --> 17:15.125
Yes.

261
17:15.125 --> 17:17.480
Xiao Ning was very good, right?

262
17:17.480 --> 17:18.772
Yes.

263
17:18.772 --> 17:20.519
Thanks.

264
17:20.519 --> 17:23.460
Since when did you become so polite, Mr. Ji?

265
17:23.460 --> 17:25.719
Let's have dinner together tonight.

266
17:26.540 --> 17:29.218
- Okay. - What do you want to eat?

267
17:29.218 --> 17:31.437
You decide, Mr. Ji.

268
17:32.506 --> 17:36.306
After all these years, you haven't changed much.

269
17:36.306 --> 17:38.054
You're still the same as before.

270
17:41.934 --> 17:43.633
What about you?

271
17:46.305 --> 17:48.165
Some things have changed...

272
17:49.586 --> 17:51.567
and some haven't.

273
17:53.947 --> 17:57.506
I wanted to take you out to eat.

274
17:57.506 --> 17:59.947
But with Xiao Ning here,

275
17:59.947 --> 18:01.813
it's not very convenient to go out.

276
18:01.813 --> 18:03.960
That's how it is when you have a child.

277
18:03.960 --> 18:06.201
They become the priority in everything.

278
18:06.201 --> 18:09.942
Why are we still eating this here?

279
18:12.440 --> 18:14.759
Mr. Shen likes this food.

280
18:14.759 --> 18:20.187
Besides, you eat pasta and steak every day.

281
18:20.187 --> 18:21.680
Aren't you tired of it yet?

282
18:21.680 --> 18:23.380
Fine.

283
18:27.992 --> 18:29.635
What if...

284
18:29.635 --> 18:33.440
What if I had followed Ji Ming Xuan to Jinxiu Mountain Villa back then?

285
18:33.440 --> 18:35.242
What would have happened?

286
18:35.242 --> 18:38.267
What if I had seen the text messages Ji Ming Xuan sent me back then?

287
18:38.267 --> 18:41.167
What if I hadn't fallen for Zhou Chu's trap?

288
18:42.440 --> 18:44.440
But there are no "what ifs".

289
18:44.440 --> 18:45.840
I missed it.

290
18:45.840 --> 18:47.780
And that's that.

291
18:50.760 --> 18:52.460
Thank you.

292
18:59.847 --> 19:01.907
When are you leaving?

293
19:03.699 --> 19:05.560
Leaving?

294
19:05.560 --> 19:07.240
Where to?

295
19:08.473 --> 19:10.239
Back home.

296
19:10.239 --> 19:11.375
Oh.

297
19:11.375 --> 19:13.300
I haven't decided yet.

298
19:13.300 --> 19:15.786
What about you, Mr. Ji?

299
19:15.786 --> 19:17.069
Oh.

300
19:18.745 --> 19:21.827
I still have some work to handle.

301
19:21.827 --> 19:24.048
So, I'll be here for a while.

302
19:25.065 --> 19:27.120
I see.

303
19:27.120 --> 19:28.820
Right.

304
19:34.680 --> 19:35.992
Mr. Ji.

305
19:35.992 --> 19:38.232
Yes?

306
19:38.232 --> 19:40.440
Are you...

307
19:40.440 --> 19:42.600
Are you free tonight?

308
19:44.860 --> 19:46.862
Aren't I free right now?

309
19:46.862 --> 19:49.482
I mean after dinner.

310
19:50.207 --> 19:51.888
I don't have much to do.

311
19:51.888 --> 19:56.640
My biggest task is putting Ji Ning to sleep.

312
19:56.640 --> 19:59.520
After Xiao Ning falls asleep...

313
20:01.427 --> 20:04.327
could you give me an hour?

314
20:08.560 --> 20:10.700
Actually, half an hour is enough.

315
20:12.065 --> 20:13.765
What is it?

316
20:16.960 --> 20:19.659
I want to paint a portrait of you.

317
20:20.406 --> 20:22.985
That's what we agreed on before...

318
20:24.493 --> 20:26.193
Wasn't it?

319
20:28.806 --> 20:31.207
When my hand heals,

320
20:31.207 --> 20:33.899
I'll paint you first, okay?

321
20:33.899 --> 20:35.599
Okay.

322
20:37.840 --> 20:39.980
So, you agree, Mr. Ji?

323
20:40.859 --> 20:42.559
Of course.

324
20:44.000 --> 20:48.326
This time, I won't let myself have any more regrets.

325
20:52.226 --> 20:55.009
Daddy, I'm so sleepy.

326
20:57.419 --> 20:59.292
Then let's go back now.

327
20:59.292 --> 21:01.445
Okay?

328
21:01.445 --> 21:03.145
Okay.

329
21:04.680 --> 21:07.162
Once I've put Ji Ning to sleep,

330
21:07.162 --> 21:09.200
I'll go and find you.

331
21:09.200 --> 21:10.480
Okay.

332
21:10.480 --> 21:11.762
No rush.

333
21:11.762 --> 21:13.162
Okay.

334
21:31.346 --> 21:33.405
Aren't you sleepy?

335
21:34.607 --> 21:36.720
Oh, come on. Tell me a story.

336
21:36.720 --> 21:40.247
I want to hear the story of the Big Bad Wolf and the Little White Rabbit.

337
21:40.247 --> 21:42.080
Why that one again?

338
21:42.080 --> 21:44.227
I've told it so many times.

339
21:44.227 --> 21:45.586
Let's pick a different one.

340
21:45.586 --> 21:49.094
No! I want to hear that one!

341
21:51.760 --> 21:54.600
I really can't say no to you.

342
21:54.600 --> 21:55.798
Once upon a time,

343
21:55.798 --> 21:58.347
there was a Big Bad Wolf

344
21:58.347 --> 22:00.566
and a Little White Rabbit.

345
22:38.839 --> 22:41.646
Gosh, Shen Mo, what are you doing?

346
22:42.706 --> 22:45.166
It's not like this is a date.

347
22:46.720 --> 22:47.960
In the end,

348
22:47.960 --> 22:51.120
the Big Bad Wolf and the Little White Rabbit became good friends.

349
22:51.120 --> 22:53.627
And they lived happily ever after.

350
22:53.627 --> 22:57.767
Huh? I don't think that's how it went last time.

351
22:58.432 --> 23:00.973
That's exactly how it went last time.

352
23:01.806 --> 23:03.006
Xiao Ning.

353
23:03.840 --> 23:06.266
The Big Bad Wolf and the Little White Rabbit

354
23:06.266 --> 23:09.467
will live together forever from now on.

355
23:09.467 --> 23:10.713
All right.

356
23:11.746 --> 23:13.386
Go to sleep.

357
24:17.960 --> 24:20.202
I'm sorry, Mr. Ji.

358
24:20.202 --> 24:22.639
I might be taking up some of your time.

359
24:22.639 --> 24:24.206
It's all right.

360
24:24.206 --> 24:25.962
I have plenty of time.

361
24:25.962 --> 24:28.142
Half an hour will be enough.

362
24:29.907 --> 24:32.605
Do you need me to pose in a certain way?

363
24:32.605 --> 24:34.306
Anything is fine.

364
24:43.626 --> 24:46.246
When did your hand get better?

365
24:47.132 --> 24:48.800
It never did.

366
24:48.800 --> 24:51.680
I've switched to drawing with my left hand.

367
24:51.680 --> 24:54.160
The injury should have healed long ago.

368
24:56.172 --> 24:58.073
Yes.

369
24:58.073 --> 25:00.574
The doctor said it's psychological.

370
25:02.919 --> 25:04.867
Then that's quite a problem.

371
25:04.867 --> 25:07.339
You'll have to overcome it on your own.

372
25:07.339 --> 25:10.593
No one else can help you with that.

373
25:40.219 --> 25:44.379
If it still hurts, just keep using your left hand.

374
25:44.379 --> 25:46.079
It's okay.

375
25:46.727 --> 25:48.673
I want to try.

376
25:48.673 --> 25:50.254
Okay.

377
25:58.016 --> 25:59.255
Don't be afraid.

378
25:59.255 --> 26:00.720
It will be fine.

379
26:00.720 --> 26:05.100
No matter what happens, I will be by your side.

380
26:16.579 --> 26:18.942
If anyone can cure me,

381
26:18.942 --> 26:21.546
it can only be you,

382
26:21.546 --> 26:23.246
Ji Ming Xuan.

383
26:27.000 --> 26:28.907
Can you do it?

384
26:28.907 --> 26:30.760
I don't know.

385
26:30.760 --> 26:32.620
I trust you.

386
26:45.907 --> 26:47.293
Aren't you going to paint?

387
26:47.293 --> 26:49.134
Yes.

388
26:49.134 --> 26:52.549
Mr. Ji, don't move.

389
26:52.549 --> 26:54.640
Shen Mo.

390
26:54.640 --> 26:57.047
This paint can be washed off tomorrow.

391
26:57.047 --> 26:58.608
I'll leave first thing in the morning.

392
26:58.608 --> 27:01.068
I won't be in your life anymore.

393
27:04.320 --> 27:06.139
Just for tonight.

394
27:08.160 --> 27:10.060
Just this once...

395
27:12.600 --> 27:14.939
Let me finish this painting.

396
27:17.600 --> 27:19.699
I've heard people say

397
27:20.699 --> 27:24.840
that wedding rings are worn on the left hand

398
27:24.840 --> 27:27.427
because it's closer to the heart.

399
27:27.427 --> 27:31.329
I once lost something very important someone gave to me.

400
27:33.000 --> 27:36.726
Now, I want to return it

401
27:37.653 --> 27:40.473
to where it truly belongs.

402
27:45.600 --> 27:47.280
Mr. Ji.

403
27:48.414 --> 27:50.514
My heart is here.

404
27:52.080 --> 27:54.180
Since seven years ago,

405
27:55.594 --> 27:57.734
it has always been here.

406
27:59.420 --> 28:01.626
On that rainy night seven years ago,

407
28:01.626 --> 28:05.279
Ji Ming Xuan placed his heart in my hands,

408
28:05.279 --> 28:07.721
but it never received a response.

409
28:07.721 --> 28:09.519
Seven years later,

410
28:09.519 --> 28:13.446
I just want Mr. Ji to see my heart, too.

411
28:18.680 --> 28:20.922
It hasn't even been half an hour.

412
28:20.922 --> 28:22.941
Let me wipe it off for you.

413
28:25.666 --> 28:28.227
Is this enough?

414
28:28.227 --> 28:31.093
Don't you need to paint a portrait?

415
28:31.093 --> 28:32.786
There's no need.

416
28:32.786 --> 28:36.127
Not everything can be expressed with a paintbrush.

417
28:44.947 --> 28:46.886
I'll wipe it off myself.

418
29:06.747 --> 29:09.327
What are your plans after returning home?

419
29:11.347 --> 29:13.687
I'll continue painting, of course.

420
29:16.387 --> 29:18.607
No plans to get married?

421
29:24.040 --> 29:26.500
I haven't met the right person yet.

422
29:32.753 --> 29:35.667
Then what kind of person is right for you?

423
29:35.667 --> 29:37.120
Huh?

424
29:37.120 --> 29:39.460
What kind of person?

425
29:40.620 --> 29:42.040
I don't know either.

426
29:42.040 --> 29:43.739
Maybe...

427
29:44.380 --> 29:45.440
someone like-minded,

428
29:45.440 --> 29:47.500
and we can talk easily.

429
29:51.146 --> 29:53.567
The Shen Mo I know

430
29:54.813 --> 29:56.586
doesn't seem to be like that.

431
29:56.586 --> 29:58.346
Oh?

432
29:58.346 --> 30:00.886
The Shen Mo I know

433
30:02.066 --> 30:04.686
should have very high standards.

434
30:12.306 --> 30:15.885
Do you think I'm good enough for you, Mr. Shen?
